      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `consume_event.py` file that consumes one message from a managed subscription or queue, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. Google Cloud Pub/Sub is a suitable choice for this task. The code will use the Google Cloud Pub/Sub client library to pull a message from a subscription. </thinking>\n",
